# On-demand JIT build products (verity_vllm/program/kernels/_jit.py): the C++ twin libraries (libtc_model.so, libfa2_model.so,
# librms_triton_model.so) compile on first use into cpp/build/ (or $VERITY_NUMERICS_BUILD_DIR) beside the builder's advisory
# lock file.  They were tracked beside their .cpp until 2026-09-23 and rewritten by every test run, dirtying every worktree.
verity_vllm/program/kernels/cpp/build/
verity_vllm/program/kernels/cpp/*.so
verity_vllm/program/kernels/cpp/*.so.lock
